      "description": "Assistant Baseball Coach- BB3720 - Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States Assistant Baseball Coach- BB3720 - Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States Kiosk mode So Take the Next Steps Assistant Baseball Coach- BB3720 Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States Staff Part-Time 3000 Add to favorites View favorites Essential Job Functions & Responsibilities: Assist in providing leadership in all aspects of assigned program Committed to compliance with the NCAA, East Coast Conference, and Mercy College regulations. Successful completion of the NCAA certification exam. Assist in identifying, evaluating and recruiting academically prepared students in accordance with College policy and NCAA regulations. Assist in providing academic oversight of student athletes to ensure retention and graduation. Assist in arranging all aspects of scheduling, team travel, team operations etc. Maintain open and harmonious communication with facets of campus community. Maintain fiscal responsibility and integrity. Maintain moral and ethical integrity. Participate in community, campus, and departmental initiatives when appropriate. Submission of all required requests / paperwork. In addition, commitment in following the letter and spirit of NCAA, Conference, and College rules and regulations. - Ability to effectively work with a diverse population of student athletes and coaches in a cultural climate that celebrates diversity. Required Skills & Experience: Education Requirements: Bachelor's degree preferred. Apply Now First Name (required) 46f543b4 Last Name (required) e3adcd29 Email (required) b9a6669f Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts Job Alert 155064cf Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Athletics Athletics Locations Dobbs Ferry,