    "https://talenthub.mercy.edu/jobs/adjunct-faculty-business-analytics-manhattan-new-york-united-states": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty – Business Analytics",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty – Business Analytics - Manhattan, New York, United States Adjunct Faculty – Business Analytics - Manhattan, New York, United States Kiosk mode So Take the Next Steps Adjunct Faculty – Business Analytics Manhattan, New York, United States Faculty Part Time $3,000.00 - $3,750.00 Add to favorites View favorites Job Summary: The Graduate Department in the School of Business at Mercy University invites applications for part-time, adjunct faculty to develop and teach specialized graduate-level Business Analytics courses. We are particularly interested in candidates with expertise in areas such as: · Customer Analytics · People (HR) Analytics · Operations Research / Optimization · AI and Data Analytics · Healthcare Analytics · Related applied analytics domains Adjunct faculty will be responsible for course development (where applicable) and subsequent instruction. Courses may be delivered in multiple modalities, including in-person at the Manhattan campus and online (synchronous and/or asynchronous). Successful candidates may be assigned up to three course assignments per term, based on program needs and enrollment. We seek instructors who demonstrate a strong commitment to inclusive excellence, student engagement, and applied, practice-oriented learning. Location · Manhattan Campus (in-person) and Online (synchronous and/or asynchronous) Minimum Qualifications · Bachelor’s and Master’s degree in Business Analytics, Data Science, Information Systems, Operations Research, or a closely related field · Minimum of five (5) years of professional experience in a business, analytics, data, or related applied setting Preferred qualifications Prior teaching experience at the college level, industry certifications, or demonstrated expertise in analytics tools, platforms, or methodologies relevant to the course area are preferred. Apply Now First Name (required) b868cb87 Last Name (required) 85bec0a5 Email (required) 6295dd7f Apply Please wait...