    "https://talenthub.mercy.edu/jobs/adjunct-faculty-media-studies-new-york-united-states": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty- Media Studies",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty- Media Studies - New York, United States Adjunct Faculty- Media Studies - New York, United States Kiosk mode So Take the Next Steps Adjunct Faculty- Media Studies New York, United States Faculty Part Time 3,750 Add to favorites View favorites Job Summary: The Media Studies program of the Communication and the Arts Department at Mercy University seeks part-time, adjunct instructors to teach Media Studies courses to undergraduate students. Successful candidates may be offered the opportunity to teach up to three section(s) of any given course, with an emphasis on journalism, radio and television production and film studies, with a maximum of three course assignments per semester. Commitment to teaching with inclusive excellence is required. Candidates may also be asked to provide assistance with program assessment and development and to attend select programmatic or professional development meetings. Schedule: Day and Evening teaching opportunities. Location: Courses may be offered at the Dobbs Ferry, Manhattan, or Bronx campuses, or online. Please attach CV and cover letter which outline your experience teaching college-level courses and the names, addresses, and telephone numbers of three professional references. Please upload all documents as one file. Please do not include any other documentation. Candidates should provide as well a statement of scholarly interests. Required Skills & Experience: • Demonstrated experience successfully teaching Media Studies at the college-level. Compensation is based on a semester and calculated on a semi-monthly pay cycle. independently with great levels of responsibility, while collaborating and communicating with a multi-campus team, required. Education Requirements: • Master's or Doctorate from an accredited institution in an appropriate academic discipline. Apply Now First Name (required) 2664a7c6 Last Name (required) e429aad1 Email (required) 01a96ba0 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Th